  "prefLabel": "Ins 2702.04 Parity Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2702.04 Parity Requirements. Group health insurance coverage offered by an insurer in connection with a group health plan issued to an employer and that provides health coverage sold under RSA420-G:2, IX must offer mental health and substance use disorder benefits coverage as required under RSA 415:18-a in compliance with the federal MHPAEA of 2008, as amended, and federal regulations adopted thereunder.\n\nSource. #9809, eff 11-8-10; ss by #12685, eff 12-3-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins2700.html"
